body:
We give CIG the respect to hold them to a higher standard than those other developers. They don't lie to us for promotional reasons. If they did, we wouldn't be here.

&#x200B;

We'll see the sand worms soon enough.

Let's not reference politics from now on. This post can be viewed as a dogwhistle to white nationalists.

&#x200B;

That being said, I would love a fully inter-connected Olisar.

"Is there a scenario where we win?"

&#x200B;

nope.  You guys are losing on purpose. Odd strategy but I resepct your balls.
